WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:01.400
Kunkun...

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:07.960
I want to... be one with you...

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.410
I want to be...

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.790
With you...

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.290
It's her last wish.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.770
Grant it.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.770
Takuya...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.140
I love you...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:10.480
"Episode 23: The Imperial City,
Where The Wind Blows"

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.190
Get some rest, Takuya.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.180
We're leaving at sunset.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:18.280
This is what that lizard wanted.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.530
She's not a lizard.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:20.530
Her name's Kunkun.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.160
You didn't have a choice.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:27.620
As long as there is possibility,
you have to keep living.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.980
I didn't even get to say
goodbye to my sister, Ailia.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:43.140
Did she say anything about me?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.160
She wondered where you were
and what you were doing.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.540
I always got into fights with her.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.730
I never saw her again
after I ran away from home.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.300
That's just how families work, right?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:09.120
She was a strict knight of the imperial city.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.810
She would've hated me
for being in the resistance.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.500
You're both a lot alike.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.500
You may have different ways of doing it,

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.760
but you're both fighting 
for Dela Granto, right?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.460
The only difference is the size of your tits.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.940
I know my sister is more feminine than me.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:36.480
I can't believe that stuck-up-girl
managed to beat me.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.940
What are you talking about?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.690
You were her man, right?

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.950
No way!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.950
If I ever went into her bedroom
she'd probably chop my head off.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.250
Really?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.250
So does that mean you're a virgi--

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.130
I was busy with the resistance!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.590
I don't have time for men!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:03:59.340
Hey!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.840
It's sunset! We're heading out!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.510
Did everybody get away?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.490
I hope Kartz and Deo are okay.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:16.950
Don't worry.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.910
They're tough.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:20.780
Damn it!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.990
Remember! We'll get you!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.200
I already forgot.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.990
Deo-<i>san</i>!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.870
Leader and the boss are gone!

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.330
We looked under the rubble, too.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:36.130
Well, knowing them they're safe and
already on their way to the imperial city.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.120
Let's head out of here before the Divine Emperor
comes to get the priestess's coffin!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.180
The coffin isn't here yet.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.850
Any word from Bazuku?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.640
Nothing since last night.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.810
The ritual is close.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.570
Have someone sent to get it immediately!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:55.500
Yes, sir!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:00.850
Wait.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.080
That was close.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.090
It just means we're close to the capital.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.610
Even here?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.270
The royal guards must've killed them.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.200
The Divine Emperor is
desperate to keep up the farce.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.620
The farce?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:52.200
The Divine Emperor himself is the
one sending the monsters from the border.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.170
To make the people obey him in their fear.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.120
That's impossible...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.500
Did you forget what happened with Sayless?

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:06.220
Your wife was used and killed
for the sake of the Emperor's lies.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:14.310
The Divine Emperor is
the cause of all our problems.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.520
The resistance will defeat him
and reveal all his lies.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.020
Your Majesty!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.020
The prisoners rioted and 
took over the quarry!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.400
So that idiot Bazuku screwed up?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.110
We've sent troops to take it back,

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.070
but many have fled already...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.970
They may attack our castle
now that it's less defended.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.080
Gather up men.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.290
But we don't have any left to spare!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.670
I will go.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.550
You have an important task.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:49.760
I permit it.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.850
Your Majesty...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.620
It is the will of Mother.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.390
That's the imperial city.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.100
The place where Sayless lived?

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.740
They know our faces.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.770
Let's split up, then.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.900
I'll tell you the location
of a resistance hideout.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.360
Let's meet up there.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.300
Got it.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.200
Okay... It stinks a little, but...

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:26.940
Here you are.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.270
Is that all we get again today?

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.720
How long will this last?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.840
I have children at home...

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.720
Don't look so glum.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.230
The Divine Emperor is looking out for us.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.810
That's right.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.400
You're right.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:49.100
As soon as the ritual is performed,
we'll be able to go back to our old lives.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.420
Um...

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.960
Can I have some too?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.200
Sorry, I'm all out.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.260
Oh no...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:05.010
If you're that hungry, have mine.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.120
But...

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.240
When we're in trouble,
we look out for each other.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.650
Some of these people are good people.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.940
That's the wanted poster 
that Sarah had of me!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.270
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.900
Nothing.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.300
I've seen you somewhere...

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.580
You have?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.160
Am I imagining it?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.530
I'll be going then.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.750
Wait!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.000
It's the man from the poster!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.060
Capture him!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.300
Stop it right there!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.590
Do you think I'm stupid 
enough to actually stop?

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.840
Go around the other side!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.130
Don't let him get away!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.560
What do I do?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.590
This way.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:06.770
Damn it.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.610
Where did he go?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.120
That way! Don't let him get away!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.740
You've put on a lot of muscle, haven't you?

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.640
Those boobs! Those curves!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.310
I see you haven't changed.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.300
Eriko-<i>sensei</i>!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.880
That's just a temporary name.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:40.570
My real name, simplified to match your
linguistic level, is Eihriulukwadrol.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.560
What are you doing here in this world?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.940
Oh, right.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.320
I need to give you your memories back.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.320
Remember now?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.030
Yeah, I remember everything.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.160
--Your measurements are 85-71-85...

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.660
--My waist is thinner than that!
--Your measurements are 85-71-85...

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.620
I was joking!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:12.770
I came to Dela Granto in search
of the Class A dimensional criminal.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.640
Ryuzoji's here too?

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:20.750
I'm not sure how he's moving around,
but I know he's here.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.060
I'm going to arrest him.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.540
You sound like the time patrol.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:30.080
A dimensional inspector is different
than a member of the time patrol.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:35.170
We can go back in time, but we
can't travel through the same history.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.840
I think I've heard something 
similar before...

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:43.990
For example, in your world there's
a philosopher named Immanuel Kant, right?

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:47.330
Yeah. The guy who married 
Mrs. Immanuel, right?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.420
According to him, our 
understanding of the world

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.420
is formed when the mind takes
the various external stimuli it's given,

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.910
and reorients them according to its
understanding of time, space, and causality.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.850
I get it! By which I mean
I don't understand at all.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.930
I'm glad I have such a good student.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.600
You're welcome.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:10.230
Essentially, it's no different
Schopenhauer's theory of representation,

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:15.950
or Einstein's theory of relativity,
or Heisenberg's uncertainty principle.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.400
Causality is what matters.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.510
Causality, I remember.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.500
It means that results 
come from causes, right?

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:25.910
Yes.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.370
Events caused by a certain causal group can

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:33.400
create any number of result groups
depending on the factors applied to them.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.190
Like roots spreading out...

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.050
The Tree of Vrinda...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.180
Indeed.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:46.010
When I came here to Dela Granto,

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.430
I attempted to observe
the flow of event elements,

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.210
and create a predictive diagram
for the Tree of Vrinda.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.440
As a result, I discovered that when the ratio
between the causality transmission speed

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.660
and the event viscosity
went above a certain level,

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.500
a phenomena occurred
where certain events became linked.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.990
A certain causal group

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.300
would be derived from
the results groups that followed it,

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.790
with events repeating as if in a spiral.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.560
A causal spiral, you could say...

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.460
In other words... it goes nowhere?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.880
Yes. Every 400 years here in Dela Granto,

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.800
the same history repeats.

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:24.330
400 year cycles again?

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.850
If my dad and Mio heard you
they'd be jumping for joy.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.920
But what is it that's repeating?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:34.400
In my position as an inspector,
I can't tell you that.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.440
What?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.860
Then don't even bring it up.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:40.970
Regardless, this world 
is in a dangerous state.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.070
There may be a collision.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.040
A collision?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.190
I'll give you this.

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:50.790
It's an event measurement device.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.470
It detects disruptions in event elements.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.620
It's already shaking in my hand...

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.800
That just shows you how 
unstable this world is.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.540
Why are you giving me this?

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:05.300
You have something you have to do now, right?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:10.410
From here on in, follow 
your path without doubt.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.520
Okay. I'll be going, then.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.170
I'd love to help you more,

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.850
but my position won't let me
get any more involved.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.530
I understand.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.740
In exchange... there's something
I'd like to get involved with.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.790
Oww!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.250
Give me three Nogard's 
Tears, in a shot glass.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.260
Understood.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.520
This way, mister.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.030
It's down here.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:07.680
Go on in.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.920
What's going on?

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:23.200
You fell for our trap,
spy of the Divine Emperor!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.920
No, you don't understand...

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.680
You think you can talk your way out of this?

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.430
Don't even try.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.330
You're working for the masked woman, right?

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.160
Don't...

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.640
I can't take any more torture!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.310
Stop it.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:39.230
Takuya's with us.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.480
Boss!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.820
Guys...

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.820
What? You should've just said something.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.490
I did!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.780
Boss! I'm so glad you're safe!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.280
You too, Kartz.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.210
Guys who call me "boss"
generally screw up and die.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.660
You too, Deo. Glad to see you're doing well.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.570
Who do you think I am?

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:06.170
My favorite porn director.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.720
Porn director?

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.090
Is that a compliment?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.040
Of course.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.450
Sorry I'm late.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.100
Are you all doing well?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.040
Leader!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:23.600
The Divine Emperor seems
to have picked another priestess.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.500
A new priestess?

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.480
As per the ancient laws,

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.110
one who carries the blood
of her predecessor was chosen.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.990
Blood...? Yu-No?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.780
The ritual is in two days,

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.000
and they're doing all they can
to hunt down the resistance.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:41.750
Another of our hideouts was just destroyed.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.540
It was the masked woman.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.710
We've lost many to her already.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.880
A skilled fighter?

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.970
If you run into her,

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:55.040
to be honest you've got
no choice but to turn tail and run.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.470
Is now the time to be scared?

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.730
There's no time left!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:03.550
How can you be such cowards, "resistance"?

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.940
Cowards, he says.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.690
Guess he doesn't like us.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.760
We were just waiting for our leaders' return.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.070
We assault their castle in the morning.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.670
We end this before the ritual begins.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.710
The future of the imperial 
city is in our hands!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.460
We'll reveal their lies for what they are

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.960
and defeat the Divine Emperor no matter what.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.340
Right!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:44.320
Did I get it?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.970
I feel so much better...

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.770
Is this...?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.320
Psychite?

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.740
Yes! I did it!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:04.010
Now if I can just get the Reflector Device back,
I can save Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.250
Come in.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.010
Can I come in?

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.260
Sure.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.000
Welcome to my palatial suite.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.230
You can't sleep?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.150
Yeah, I guess.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.900
Want me to sing you a lullaby?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.530
I can understand why you're nervous.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.690
The mission starts tomorrow morning.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:41.690
Takuya.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.670
This may be our last night alive.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.800
Takuya... I want you to do something for me.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.300
You're the only one I can ask.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:46.660
Per the plan, I'll lead team one
in through the less-defended rear gate.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:50.770
Takuya will lead team two
in through the sewers.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:53.900
We're all ready, right?

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:54.840
Right!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.850
Amanda. Use this sword.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:01.930
It's Ailia's sword.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.920
You keep it.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.410
It's better off in your hands.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.380
Hey there.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.010
Get some rest.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.610
Night!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.830
Take care of him.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.490
Okay.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.440
Well? Do we take them out?

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.700
No, just walk past them.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.740
This is the door.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:09.820
It won't open.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.660
Hey, stop.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.200
That place is off-limits.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.760
Go through the south corridor.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.000
This is bad.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.250
We're stuck here?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.920
Huh? You scared, Deo-<i>san</i>?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.710
Proof? Do you have any proof?

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.300
All I need to do is look at you.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.380
I don't have a choice.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.490
It'll make a lot of noise, but...

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.350
Get back. I'm lighting it up.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.640
You there!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.940
I found you, rats!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.360
That's her!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:57.690
The masked woman!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:20:59.780
Get going.

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:01.320
But, boss...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.110
O-Okay, you handle this!

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.570
Let's go, Kartz!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.040
You follow the ones that fled.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.080
I'll handle this.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:11.790
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.530
Y-Yu-No?!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.160
It's you, Yu-No!

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:48.890
What's going on?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:50.690
Why...?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.810
Did you forget me?

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.040
I'm your dad!

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:01.250
Die!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Episode 24: The Truth About Dela Granto"

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.570
Episode 24: "The Truth About Dela Granto."
